{"id": "UCL_20261002_001", "source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "source_kind": "user_explicit_setting_clarification", "recorded_on": "2026-10-02", "recorded_date_timezone": "Europe/Paris", "version": 1, "source_confirmation": "explicitly_stated_by_user", "transcription_status": "source_preserved_with_structured_interpretation", "source_document": "C:\\Users\\pit\\.codex\\worktrees\\yulinfeng-tavern-plan\\TRPG outputs\\work\\replay_research\\user_clarifications.md", "source_locator": {"heading": "UCL_20261002_001", "quote_start_line": 13, "quote_end_line": 16, "conversation_message_id": null, "context": "Reply following the assistant answer to 飘零大陆的法则是什么"}, "verbatim": "其实我想考就的便是第三点，不过我可以补充。\n譬如手枪（科技大陆）的产物，就没办法在飘零大陆生效，但如果是用魔导技术制成的类似手枪的产物，那么因为原理上不同就可以使用。\n此外，极强者是可以无视，突破法则在飘零大陆施展自己的实力。 打个比方，一个真正的剑仙，就可以使用炎黄大陆的剑气，而一个普通剑客就不行。\n再补充一点，技能，技巧是不被限制的，而御临风的剑气没被限制，是因为它既是斗气也是剑气，处在两者之间。", "topic_targets": ["WRC_002", "WRC_001", "CRC_001"], "claims": [{"id": "UCL_20261002_001_01", "topic_targets": ["WRC_002"], "text": "科技大陆的手枪无法在飘零大陆生效。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户本轮直接补充世界设定", "source_ref": {"document_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:\\Users\\pit\\.codex\\worktrees\\yulinfeng-tavern-plan\\TRPG outputs\\work\\replay_research\\user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 14, "line_end": 14, "quote": "譬如手枪（科技大陆）的产物，就没办法在飘零大陆生效，但如果是用魔导技术制成的类似手枪的产物，那么因为原理上不同就可以使用。"}}, {"id": "UCL_20261002_001_02", "topic_targets": ["WRC_002"], "text": "采用魔导技术制成的类似手枪因原理不同，可在飘零大陆使用。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户本轮直接补充世界设定", "source_ref": {"document_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:\\Users\\pit\\.codex\\worktrees\\yulinfeng-tavern-plan\\TRPG outputs\\work\\replay_research\\user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 14, "line_end": 14, "quote": "譬如手枪（科技大陆）的产物，就没办法在飘零大陆生效，但如果是用魔导技术制成的类似手枪的产物，那么因为原理上不同就可以使用。"}}, {"id": "UCL_20261002_001_03", "topic_targets": ["WRC_002"], "text": "极强者可以无视或突破这种法则限制；真正剑仙能够在飘零大陆使用炎黄大陆剑气，普通剑客不行。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户本轮直接补充世界设定", "source_ref": {"document_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:\\Users\\pit\\.codex\\worktrees\\yulinfeng-tavern-plan\\TRPG outputs\\work\\replay_research\\user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 15, "line_end": 15, "quote": "此外，极强者是可以无视，突破法则在飘零大陆施展自己的实力。 打个比方，一个真正的剑仙，就可以使用炎黄大陆的剑气，而一个普通剑客就不行。"}}, {"id": "UCL_20261002_001_04", "topic_targets": ["WRC_002"], "text": "技能、技巧不受这种跨大陆法则限制。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户本轮直接补充世界设定", "source_ref": {"document_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:\\Users\\pit\\.codex\\worktrees\\yulinfeng-tavern-plan\\TRPG outputs\\work\\replay_research\\user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 16, "line_end": 16, "quote": "再补充一点，技能，技巧是不被限制的，而御临风的剑气没被限制，是因为它既是斗气也是剑气，处在两者之间。"}}, {"id": "UCL_20261002_001_05", "topic_targets": ["WRC_002", "CRC_001"], "text": "御临风的剑气兼具斗气与剑气性质、处于两者之间，因此不受这一限制。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户本轮直接补充世界设定", "source_ref": {"document_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:\\Users\\pit\\.codex\\worktrees\\yulinfeng-tavern-plan\\TRPG outputs\\work\\replay_research\\user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 16, "line_end": 16, "quote": "再补充一点，技能，技巧是不被限制的，而御临风的剑气没被限制，是因为它既是斗气也是剑气，处在两者之间。"}}], "effective_time": "Clarifies the setting mechanism and Yulinfeng existing power nature; not an acquisition at the date of this conversation. Applies to opening abilities only insofar as already possessed.", "knowledge_time": "User clarification does not establish which in-world characters know the mechanism at each stage.", "editorial_inference": "Compatibility depends on operating principle, power nature and user capability; no complete numeric adjudication formula supplied.", "not_inferred": ["All technology fails", "All mixed powers bypass restrictions", "Strong beings are immune to every law", "Any named sword cultivator meets the threshold", "Yulinfeng is a true sword immortal or has unlimited resources", "The full list, map and history of four continents"], "formal_export_approved": false, "original_campaign_post_count_contribution": 0}
{"id": "UCL_20261003_001", "source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "source_kind": "user_explicit_setting_clarification", "recorded_on": "2026-10-03", "recorded_date_timezone": "Europe/Paris", "source_confirmation": "explicitly_stated_by_user", "verbatim": "不如用一种思维来想想是否冲突，那就是如果御临风改变选择，这些事情还会发生吗？\n那么显然，高塔还是会遭袭，白魔仍然会脱逃。\n而帝与哈克本来就是兄弟，不需要主角做什么，事情也会存在。\n所以我不太明白为什么要更改既定事实，譬如情感交易本就被我写在了过往历史里。 其次成长期用指的是？", "source_document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "source_locator": {"heading": "UCL_20261003_001", "quote_start_line": 42, "quote_end_line": 45, "conversation_message_id": null}, "claims": [{"id": "UCL_20261003_001_01", "text": "判断重玩变化时应检查御临风改变选择是否真正改变该事件因果，而不是随意替换已定事实。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户本轮直接澄清", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 42, "line_end": 42}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_001_02", "text": "高塔仍会遭袭，白魔仍会脱逃，不因御临风另作选择就自动取消。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户本轮直接澄清", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 43, "line_end": 43}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_001_03", "text": "帝与哈克本来就是兄弟；关系不依赖御临风参与。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户本轮直接澄清", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 44, "line_end": 44}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_001_04", "text": "情感交易已写入御临风的过往历史，属于开局前既定经历。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户本轮直接澄清", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 45, "line_end": 45}}], "not_inferred": ["所有未来结果无条件固定", "情感交易的受益者在本条另获新说明", "用户本条逐项重新批准成长数值", "正式第二阶段导出已授权"]}
{"id": "UCL_20261003_002", "source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "source_kind": "user_explicit_replay_growth_instruction", "recorded_on": "2026-10-03", "recorded_date_timezone": "Europe/Paris", "source_confirmation": "explicitly_stated_by_user", "verbatim": "但这个成长也只是开局状态，之后的不需要再管了，不过有队友属性的NPC可以随着时间和我本来给予的人物模板继续成长，但主角应该自己重新选择成长道路", "source_document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "source_locator": {"heading": "UCL_20261003_002", "quote_start_line": 70, "quote_end_line": 70, "conversation_message_id": null}, "claims": [{"id": "UCL_20261003_002_01", "text": "原团成长用于还原开局状态，御临风原线之后的成长不再作为重玩必须跟随的路线。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户本轮成长约定", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 70, "line_end": 70}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_002_02", "text": "有队友属性的NPC可以随时间按照用户原本给予的人物模板继续成长。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户本轮成长约定", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 70, "line_end": 70}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_002_03", "text": "主角御临风在开局后由用户重新选择成长道路。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户本轮成长约定", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 70, "line_end": 70}}], "not_inferred": ["既有原团后期档案应被删除", "NPC获得所有原线事件奖励", "新增统一成长速率或经验公式", "正式导出或实际游玩已开始"]}
