{"id": "UCL_20261003_004", "source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "source_kind": "user_explicit_setting_clarification", "recorded_on": "2026-10-03", "recorded_date_timezone": "Europe/Paris", "source_confirmation": "explicitly_stated_by_user", "verbatim": "补充，雷光是唯一一个拥有自己秘密情报部门的人，其次我怎么觉得世界模型里帝国的资料反而比较少，而源资料较少的沐透线以及大墓地线反而贡献了更多的资料。\n高塔是受到魔物以及魔兽之潮的双重冲击，悠悠年龄资料卡上有，空间龙的惨剧里秘境里空间龙几乎全灭，只剩悠悠。\n陈萍生是慕少艾的徒弟，也就是资料开局被御临风制裁的魔法师。\n欧基和欧吉尔德明显是不同的人，身处的故事线也不同，欧基是哈克的同伴。\n博士和旧标签指的是什么 ？ 黑衣女性的出处在哪。\n八柱将的设定参考《传颂之物》（受赞颂者）系列中的**大和“八柱将”，以及系列第三部作品《传颂之物 二人的白皇》**  ，但是没有德考波姆，由奥修特尔，也就是右近代替。\n公开婚约不等于爱情又是指的什么?", "source_document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "source_locator": {"heading": "UCL_20261003_004", "quote_start_line": 114, "quote_end_line": 120, "conversation_message_id": null}, "claims": [{"id": "UCL_20261003_004_01", "text": "雷光拥有自己的秘密情报部门，并是唯一拥有这种自身部门者。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确修订；年龄依据用户指定的本人资料卡", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 114, "line_end": 114}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_004_02", "text": "高塔受到魔物之潮与魔兽之潮的双重冲击。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确修订；年龄依据用户指定的本人资料卡", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 115, "line_end": 115}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_004_03", "text": "悠悠年龄采用本人资料卡记载的11岁。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确修订；年龄依据用户指定的本人资料卡", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 115, "line_end": 115}, "additional_source_refs": [{"source_id": "REF_CHARACTERS", "path": "D:\\备份文件\\901记录\\TRPG outputs\\设定 人物\\人物卡资料集_检索版.md", "line_start": 1601, "line_end": 1601}, {"source_id": "REF_SETTING", "path": "D:\\备份文件\\901记录\\TRPG outputs\\设定 人物\\妄想大陆设定集_检索版.md", "line_start": 114, "line_end": 114}]}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_004_04", "text": "空间龙旧秘境惨剧中，该秘境空间龙几乎全灭，只剩悠悠。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确修订；年龄依据用户指定的本人资料卡", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 115, "line_end": 115}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_004_05", "text": "陈萍生是慕少艾的徒弟，也是开局阶段被御临风制裁的魔法师。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确修订；年龄依据用户指定的本人资料卡", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 116, "line_end": 116}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_004_06", "text": "欧基与欧吉尔德是不同人物。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确修订；年龄依据用户指定的本人资料卡", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 117, "line_end": 117}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_004_07", "text": "欧基是哈克的同伴。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确修订；年龄依据用户指定的本人资料卡", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 117, "line_end": 117}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_004_08", "text": "本团八柱将设定参考《传颂之物》大和八柱将及《二人的白皇》。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确修订；年龄依据用户指定的本人资料卡", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 119, "line_end": 119}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_004_09", "text": "本团八柱将没有德考波姆，由奥修特尔（右近）替代。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确修订；年龄依据用户指定的本人资料卡", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 119, "line_end": 119}}], "topic_targets": ["WRC_005", "WRC_007", "WRC_066", "WRC_009", "WRC_026", "WRC_033", "WRC_037", "WRC_011", "WRC_024", "WRC_044", "CRC_018", "CRC_016", "CRC_051", "CRC_054", "CRC_055", "CRC_059", "CRC_060"], "not_inferred": ["No formal export approval.", "No invented birthdays, hidden alias plot or additional space-dragon survivor.", "No automatic transplantation of original-game events or removal of the Emperor's Brotherhood."], "formal_export_approved": false, "original_campaign_post_count_contribution": 0}
{"id": "UCL_20261003_005", "source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "source_kind": "user_explicit_setting_clarification", "recorded_on": "2026-10-03", "recorded_date_timezone": "Europe/Paris", "source_confirmation": "explicitly_stated_by_user", "verbatim": "黑衣女性命名为美杜莎，也是phanthom，同时是忠诚于白魔的手下。\n欧基,哈克,帝以及相关的一些人物都有以传颂之物为原型，建议你读取后补充它们的设定。\n然后是测试问题，你知道御临风的身份吗？", "source_document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "source_locator": {"heading": "UCL_20261003_005", "quote_start_line": 146, "quote_end_line": 148}, "claims": [{"id": "UCL_20261003_005_01", "text": "大墓地线黑衣女性命名为美杜莎。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确命名、设定补充或原型说明", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 146, "line_end": 146}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_005_02", "text": "美杜莎是Phantom。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确命名、设定补充或原型说明", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 146, "line_end": 146}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_005_03", "text": "美杜莎是忠诚于白色魔法师的手下。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确命名、设定补充或原型说明", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 146, "line_end": 146}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_005_04", "text": "欧基、哈克、帝以及相关人物以《传颂之物》为原型，用户要求读取原型后补充设定。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确命名、设定补充或原型说明", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 147, "line_end": 147}}], "topic_targets": ["CRC_122", "WRC_040", "CRC_006", "CRC_008", "CRC_059"], "formal_export_approved": false, "original_campaign_post_count_contribution": 0}
{"id": "UCL_20261003_006", "source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "source_kind": "user_explicit_setting_clarification", "recorded_on": "2026-10-03", "recorded_date_timezone": "Europe/Paris", "source_confirmation": "explicitly_stated_by_user", "verbatim": "那你对御临风是怎么来到异界的知情吗。\n其次补充一下，所谓的异乡之龙，其实是华夏人都是龙的传人的一种解释", "source_document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "source_locator": {"heading": "UCL_20261003_006", "quote_start_line": 171, "quote_end_line": 172}, "claims": [{"id": "UCL_20261003_006_01", "text": "本团所谓异乡之龙，是对“华夏人都是龙的传人”的一种解释；御临风的龙血按这一背景理解。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确世界观解释", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 172, "line_end": 172}}], "topic_targets": ["CRC_001"], "formal_export_approved": false, "original_campaign_post_count_contribution": 0}
{"id": "UCL_20261003_007", "source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "source_kind": "user_explicit_setting_clarification", "recorded_on": "2026-10-03", "recorded_date_timezone": "Europe/Paris", "source_confirmation": "explicitly_stated_by_user", "verbatim": "你知道无限恐怖吗？ 其实御临风是被主神带到异世界的，一开始他们甚至会接收到主神的任务。\n但随着团的软重启（也就是从村子开始），主神和幻剑机制旧直接消失了。", "source_document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "source_locator": {"heading": "UCL_20261003_007", "quote_start_line": 186, "quote_end_line": 187}, "claims": [{"id": "UCL_20261003_007_01", "text": "御临风是被主神带到异世界的。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确前史及团软重启说明", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 186, "line_end": 186}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_007_02", "text": "早期御临风等人会接收主神发布的任务。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确前史及团软重启说明", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 186, "line_end": 186}}, {"id": "UCL_20261003_007_03", "text": "团从村子开始软重启，主神与幻剑机制由此直接移除。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确前史及团软重启说明", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 187, "line_end": 187}}], "topic_targets": ["CRC_001"], "formal_export_approved": false, "original_campaign_post_count_contribution": 0}
{"id": "UCL_20261003_008", "source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "source_kind": "user_explicit_setting_clarification", "recorded_on": "2026-10-03", "recorded_date_timezone": "Europe/Paris", "source_confirmation": "explicitly_stated_by_user", "verbatim": "白色魔法师，以及相关phatom机制则可以参考假面骑士 wizard。\n其次，告诉我接下来的规划作业", "source_document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "source_locator": {"heading": "UCL_20261003_008", "quote_start_line": 205, "quote_end_line": 206}, "claims": [{"id": "UCL_20261003_008_01", "text": "白色魔法师及相关Phantom机制可以参考《假面骑士 Wizard》。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确原型参考授权", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 205, "line_end": 205}}], "topic_targets": ["CRC_011", "CRC_122"], "formal_export_approved": false, "original_campaign_post_count_contribution": 0}
{"id": "UCL_20261003_009", "source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "source_kind": "user_review_feedback_and_setting_clarification", "recorded_on": "2026-10-03", "recorded_date_timezone": "Europe/Paris", "source_confirmation": "explicitly_stated_by_user_with_uncertain_hypothesis_preserved", "verbatim": "恐惧圆环词条里，匿名少女可以推测为魔兽山脉五巨头之一或者相关人员。\n帝国确实不提倡宗教。\n魔物之盒打开后虽然能实现愿望，但可能会以比较扭曲，暴力的粗暴方式实现，也可以参考传颂之物。\n空间龙部族覆灭词条这里的语法似乎有点奇怪\n，谢尔伦称入侵者被凌迟杀，歼敌分工保留差异〔uncertain〕，不能由凌迟道歉认其亲手屠族。惨剧影响悠悠存续、护送及龙族外交。\n不是凌迟灭族，为什么变成不能由凌迟道歉认其亲手屠族\n悠悠的本名请不要遗失", "source_document": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "source_locator": {"heading": "UCL_20261003_009", "quote_start_line": 220, "quote_end_line": 226}, "claims": [{"text": "恐惧圆环仪式中的匿名少女可能是魔兽山脉五巨头之一，或与五巨头有关的人员。", "certainty": "uncertain", "attribution": "用户提出的身份推测", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 220, "line_end": 220}, "id": "UCL_20261003_009_01"}, {"text": "帝国不提倡宗教。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确设定补充", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 221, "line_end": 221}, "id": "UCL_20261003_009_02"}, {"text": "魔物之盒能够实现愿望，但实现方式可能扭曲、暴力或粗暴。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户明确机制补充；可能性不改写成必然结果", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 222, "line_end": 222}, "id": "UCL_20261003_009_03"}, {"text": "魔物之盒的愿望机制可以参考《传颂之物》。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户原型参考授权，不等于自动引入原作全部事实", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 222, "line_end": 222}, "id": "UCL_20261003_009_04"}, {"text": "凌迟不是造成空间龙部族灭族的加害者。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户纠正将考据防误读说明写成凶手疑问的措辞", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 225, "line_end": 225}, "id": "UCL_20261003_009_05"}, {"text": "悠悠的本名必须在档案及卡稿中保留；具体拼写与分期继续由原人物资料和原帖支撑。", "certainty": "confirmed", "attribution": "用户对人物资料保留的明确要求", "source_ref": {"source_id": "REF_USER_CLARIFICATIONS", "path": "C:/Users/pit/.codex/worktrees/yulinfeng-tavern-plan/TRPG outputs/work/replay_research/user_clarifications.md", "line_start": 226, "line_end": 226}, "id": "UCL_20261003_009_06"}], "topic_targets": ["WRC_005", "WRC_044", "WRC_068", "WRC_071", "WRC_072", "CRC_010"], "whole_draft_approved": false, "original_campaign_post_count_contribution": 0}
